To elaborate, there are RAY wands and BEAM wands.

RAY wands are digging, magic missile, cold, fire, lightning, sleep, and
death.

BEAM wands are nothing, licking, make invisible, opening, probing, slow
monster, speed monster, striking, undead turning, cancellation,
polymorph, and teleportation.

(There are also NODIR wands, these are light, enlightenment, secret door
detection, create monster and wishing.)

RAY wands produce a visible ray if you're not blind, BEAM wands are
*not* visible.

RAY wands may bounce off walls, while BEAM wands don't. The obvious
exception to this rule of thumb are of course wands of digging (RAY),
which are visible, but don't bounce.

